# Contracts scope (path-scoped)

- Scope unrelated validation: `forge test --no-match-path 'test/vault/strategies/CreatorOVaultStrategies.Rebalance.*'`
- ~65 pre-existing Rebalance failures on main — do not treat as regressions from unrelated edits.
- Use lane-neutral interface names (`*4626` suffix) per `guard:registry4626-naming`.
- Arms = ShareOFT mesh (CCA, LP); legs = yield strategies (Charm, Ajna) — never call arms "strategies".
- Deploy status/preflight scripts are read-only — no onchain mutation as side effect.

Validate: `pnpm -C frontend validate:contracts` or `forge test --match-path test/<area>/`.

